cjw_newsletter INSTALL
======================

The installation (with Composer or by hand, the database tables, the content classes, the settings and the cron
jobs) is described in README.md, section "Installation". An upgrade from 4.1 is described in doc/upgrade-4.2.md.

The database updates from older releases (1.x to 4.2) are in update/database/<engine>/<version>/, one file per
step; run those of the releases in between, in order.
